# Lab 6 - Raft Election Protocol

## Usage with RPC Setup

cd into the lab6 directory

```sh
cd lab6
```

Next open up 8 terminals for the clients, you can split them with the Split Terminal button for vertical split and holding 'Alt' for horizontal splits.

In each terminal, start each node via

```sh
go run raft.go
```

Try to do this somewhat quickly so that they all start around the same time.
